{"sentences":[{"id":"s_work_cdt_150_1","chapterId":"ch_work_cdt_150","textTraditional":"一、十有八年。春王正月，晉殺其大夫胥童。","sentenceOrder":1},{"id":"s_work_cdt_150_2","chapterId":"ch_work_cdt_150","textTraditional":"二、庚申，晉弒其君州蒲。","sentenceOrder":2},{"id":"s_work_cdt_150_3","chapterId":"ch_work_cdt_150","textTraditional":"三、齊殺其大夫國佐。","sentenceOrder":3},{"id":"s_work_cdt_150_4","chapterId":"ch_work_cdt_150","textTraditional":"四、公如晉。","sentenceOrder":4},{"id":"s_work_cdt_150_5","chapterId":"ch_work_cdt_150","textTraditional":"五、夏，楚子、鄭伯伐宋。","sentenceOrder":5},{"id":"s_work_cdt_150_6","chapterId":"ch_work_cdt_150","textTraditional":"六、宋魚石復入于彭城。","sentenceOrder":6},{"id":"s_work_cdt_150_7","chapterId":"ch_work_cdt_150","textTraditional":"七、公至自晉。","sentenceOrder":7},{"id":"s_work_cdt_150_8","chapterId":"ch_work_cdt_150","textTraditional":"八、晉侯使士匄來聘。","sentenceOrder":8},{"id":"s_work_cdt_150_9","chapterId":"ch_work_cdt_150","textTraditional":"九、秋，〈木巳〉伯來朝。","sentenceOrder":9},{"id":"s_work_cdt_150_10","chapterId":"ch_work_cdt_150","textTraditional":"十、八月，邾婁子來朝。","sentenceOrder":10},{"id":"s_work_cdt_150_11","chapterId":"ch_work_cdt_150","textTraditional":"十一、築鹿囿。","sentenceOrder":11},{"id":"s_work_cdt_150_12","chapterId":"ch_work_cdt_150","textTraditional":"何以書？譏。何譏爾？有囿矣，又為也。","sentenceOrder":12},{"id":"s_work_cdt_150_13","chapterId":"ch_work_cdt_150","textTraditional":"十二、己丑，公薨于路寢。","sentenceOrder":13},{"id":"s_work_cdt_150_14","chapterId":"ch_work_cdt_150","textTraditional":"十三、冬，楚人、鄭人侵宋。","sentenceOrder":14},{"id":"s_work_cdt_150_15","chapterId":"ch_work_cdt_150","textTraditional":"十四、晉侯使士彭來乞師。","sentenceOrder":15},{"id":"s_work_cdt_150_16","chapterId":"ch_work_cdt_150","textTraditional":"十五、十有二月，仲孫蔑會晉侯、宋公、衞侯、邾婁子、齊崔杼同盟于虛朾。","sentenceOrder":16},{"id":"s_work_cdt_150_17","chapterId":"ch_work_cdt_150","textTraditional":"十六、丁未，葬我君成公。","sentenceOrder":17}],"overrides":{}}